# apps/web build-time env vars (Vite reads these at `pnpm build`).
#
# Defaults are tuned for the recommended deploy: SPA on Vercel, API on
# Render, with Vercel rewrites pointing /api and /ws at the API origin.
# In that mode the SPA never sees the API origin directly — leave
# VITE_API_BASE_URL empty.
#
# Override only when running a split-origin deploy without Vercel
# rewrites (uncommon; brings CORS + cross-site cookie complexity).

# Empty default → SPA fetches relative `/api/v1/...` and `/ws`.
# Set to a full origin (https://api.example.com) to bake an absolute
# URL into the bundle. Trailing slash will be ignored.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
